    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41044" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστολ-εύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>,
			ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστολή</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>secretary</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ Αὐτοκράτορος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.1085
				</span></i>
			; also in Persia, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστέλλει</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. among the
			Spartans, <i>admiral second in command, vice-admiral</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				2.1.7
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				4.8.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				7
			</span></i>; he carries dispatches, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				1.1.23
			</span></i>.</div>
